# Example pipe service for raw DMARC XML payloads.
#
# This assumes the delivery agent receives a raw aggregate report payload on
# stdin. If the mailbox receives full MIME messages, extract supported XML,
# gzip, or zip attachments before invoking `meil ingest`.
#
# meil-dmarc unix - n n - - pipe
#   flags=Rq user=meil argv=/usr/local/bin/meil ingest -
